"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Ograničenja brzine, veza po torrentu, učitavanja i sjetve se postavljaju za svaki torrent kada ga dodate, ili kasnije pod Postavke torrenta. Torrentovi koriste proxy iz kartice Veza (HTTP ili SOCKS5, ili Mac proxy sa \"Koristi sistemske postavke\") i ograničenje brzine za sva preuzimanja. Promjene se primjenjuju na torrente pokrenute nakon toga. Peers i trackeri mogu vidjeti vašu IP adresu, ili vaš proxy.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Postavke koje se koriste za svako preuzimanje sa web stranice. Stranica također pokriva svoje poddomene (example.com pokriva www.example.com). Prijave se šalju samo na tu stranicu i čuvaju se zajedno sa ostalim tajnama aplikacije.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "Sigurnosna kopija sadrži vaše postavke, postavke stranica, redove i listu preuzimanja. Šifre i kolačići se nikad ne stavljaju u sigurnosnu kopiju.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Kada kopirate link koji završava u jednom od ovih tipova, prozor Dodaj se otvara s njim.";
